  m_Text: "D\xFC\u015Fmanlar\u0131n d\xFC\u015F\xFCrd\xFC\u011F\xFC XP ta\u015Flar\u0131n\u0131 topla, seviye atla ve her seviyede bir y\xFCkseltme se\xE7.\nHer dakika bir <b>BOSS</b> gelir: yen ve d\xFC\u015F\xFCrd\xFC\u011F\xFC hazine sand\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 al.\n8:00'de gelen <b>SON BOSS</b>'u yenersen oyunu kazan\u0131rs\u0131n!"
